      "body": "@NickLucche @njhill could you take a look at this small stop-string validation fix if you have bandwidth? It prevents `skip_tokenizer_init` requests from accepting stop strings that require a tokenizer, while keeping token-ID stops usable without one. I also checked the Mergify conflict; it should just be keeping this new stop validation alongside main’s new diffusion validation in `SamplingParams.verify()`.",
